rial, sans-serif; color: rgb(5, 5, 5); font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">In the morning of 06 May 2022, H.E. Dr. Taing Nguonly, executive director of Techo Startup Center, led a delegate team to visit the Cambodia University of Technology and Science (CamTech) to discuss a possible collaboration. The discussion underscored digital skills, which are necessary in the 21st century, the possibility of sending CamTech students to various competitions, and the possible collaboration with Techo Startup Center. <span style=\"font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">At the same time, the two parties also discussed human resource exchange between the two institutions in a form called \u201ctalent pool\u201d on research, business, and technology. After the discussion, the delegation went around CamTech campus to see our facilities, labs, and three project rooms. CamTech is currently running three major projects:  an AI-powered motorbike training using VR App, an AI-powered plant diagnosis and optimal fertilizer spreading model using drone &amp; hyperspectral camera, and interior design using augmented and mixed reality.<\/span><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-55bae5c5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"55bae5c5\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7a3e7e3f\" data-id=\"7a3e7e3f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-el